    "body": "I'd like to get rid of \"read all bytes as a promise\". Nobody should use it, for various reasons (e.g. having to deal with `then` tampering). https://dontcallmedom.github.io/webdex/r.html#read%20all%20bytes%40%40ReadableStreamDefaultReader%40dfn implies it wouldn't be so bad to break some consumers; I think we could fix Fetch ourselves, file issues on the rest, then move on.",
