    "body": "Hmm, I realized I made this more complicated because \"get a copy of the bytes held\" expects a BufferSource, but chunk steps get arbitrary values, which given the current state of the spec I'm not sure if they're even IDL versus JavaScript values.\r\n\r\nProbably best to just revert this to the previous imprecise wording (including the type check and reject). Eventually we can do a pass through the spec to use the new-ish IDL BufferSource manipulation stuff everywhere. Sorry for thinking that this sub-case would be easier and thus worth doing while you were in the area.",
